    "sections": {
        "description": "NewsCave is a fast, responsive, and SEO-friendly dark mode WordPress theme designed for modern news sites, online magazines, blogs, newspaper portals, and digital publishers. Powered by lightweight code and speed optimization, NewsCave delivers exceptional performance, high Core Web Vitals, and an enhanced dark UI/UX for comfortable nighttime reading. It features 50+ pre-designed starter sites fully compatible with the Gutenberg Block Editor, Elementor, and popular page builders for instant one-click demo import. Built with customizable header/footer layouts, flexible block patterns, category banner styles, seamless WooCommerce integration, full RTL and multilingual (WPML) readiness, and accessibility-focused standards, it gives you complete design control. NewsCave integrates smoothly with leading plugins like Yoast SEO, Rank Math, Jetpack, and Contact Form 7 to help you launch a high-traffic, professional news or magazine publication with ease. Explore the live preview and demo at https://afthemes.com/products/newscave/"
    },
